      487.92,
      302.95,
      581.99
    ],
    "text": "The allotments of Land, containing in extent of 0.1060 Hectare,Lots 1 - 3 (3 lots) under mentioned land shown in the SurveyorGeneral\u2019s Preliminery Plan No. 1745 dated on 14.09.2018situated in the Minor Division of Wagapanaha PallesiyaPaththuwa in the Village of Welamitiyawa in the GramaNiladhari Division of Welamitiyawa (E 440 D), in DambullaDivisional Secretary\u2019s Division in Matale District of CentralProvince.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
